## Scene 1

[[FSE PRESET jack pos=-1,0.3 facing=dsc; PRESET algernon pos=-4,2 facing=90; PRESET gwendolen pos=3.5,-0.5 facing=270; PRESET lane pos=2.5,2 facing=180; PRESET cecily pos=1,-1; PRESET chasuble pos=-2,-2; PRESET prism pos=-1.5,-2.5; PRESET merriman pos=5,2.5; PRESET guest-1 pos=4,3; PRESET guest-2 pos=4.5,3.4; PRESET guest-3 pos=3,3.2; PRESET guest-4 pos=-5,1; PRESET guest-5 pos=-5.5,0; PRESET musician pos=-3.2,2.6; PRESET footman pos=0,3.5; PRESET cigarette-case with=algernon; PRESET diary with=gwendolen; PRESET fan with=cecily]]

!@Algernon plays the piano badly. @Lane lays out tea. The guests mill about.

ALGERNON
Did you hear what I was playing, Lane?

[[FSE ENTER lady-b from=door-sl pos=5,0; SET handbag with=lady-b]]

LADY BRACKNELL
A handbag?
